                "title": "EOR & PEO in Timor-Leste",
                "subtitle": "Compliant Employment in Dili",
                "description": "Hire staff in Timor-Leste without a local entity. We handle the 2012 Labor Law compliance, Social Security (CESS) contributions, and USD payroll.",
